Hello James,<br />
&nbsp;<br />
We are fast approaching Spring and saying good-bye to the New England Winter.&nbsp; And with that comes the planning for the next school year, and for the Red Cross, finding new sponsors to work with for the 2018-19 school year.&nbsp; We are committed to providing a great learning experience with our school programs for the students, and providing an earned scholarship for the school. &nbsp;I understand the resistance to not running during the school day, and that is not an issue. &nbsp;This program can be applied at after school drives and it will allow for community to come and help get the numbers higher. &nbsp;I have included a one page for this year&#39;s program. &nbsp;I look forward to speaking with you and looking at the calendars together.<br />
